# Conformance probe pack for the bits left at a counted group (spec 0.21
# ruling 20 with ruling 14 of 0.8), most significant bit first. Public. No
# kinds.
#
#   n           an 8-bit count of nums
#   p           one presence bit, then 7 unused bits
#   x           8 bits
#   nums        n items; an item is val in 8 bits when p.1 is 1, and nothing
#               when it is 0
format     conformance-extents-bitsleft
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
count n 8
presence p 1
pad 7
field   probe.x  8  uint
group   probe.nums count @n
  if p.1
    field  probe.val  8  uint
  end
end
